<title>USA: TABLE - Bob Evans Farms Inc Q1 shr rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Bob Evans Farms Inc Q1 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		  1996</p>
<p>Net Sales</p>
<p> Restaurant Segment	     $163,227,000	$156,179,000</p>
<p> Food Products Segment	    58,818,000	  56,881,000</p>
<p>     Total			   222,045,000	 213,060,000</p>
<p>Operating Income</p>
<p> Restaurant Segment		 15,919,000	  13,303,000</p>
<p> Food Products Segment	     1,143,000	     873,000</p>
<p>	Total			   17,062,000	  14,176,000</p>
<p> Income Before Income Taxes     16,473,000	  14,242,000</p>
<p> Net Income			   10,361,000	   8,901,000</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share			.25		   .21</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p> common shares outstanding	41,589,540	  42,273,714</p>
<p>NOTES: Company said the closing of its 15 Cantina del Rio restaurants in August 1996 dampened the sales comparison but boosted net income.</p>
<p>Periods ended July 25 vs July 26.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
